cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these certificates or programs, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Binary BBP-type formulas for L(2, chi_d): certificates, search and checks"
abstract: "Five-term-relation certificates, checked in exact arithmetic, for binary BBP-type formulas for L(2, chi_-8) and L(2, chi_-20), for the identities (27), (29), (30) and (37) of Borwein and Broadhurst (1998) and for a dilogarithm identity on the Galois orbit of exp(pi i/20)/sqrt 2; the exhaustive search of base-b points with its complete output; the verifiers, the proof-step programs and the numerical checks behind the paper \"Binary BBP-type formulas for L(2, chi_d): a Bloch-group criterion, an exhaustive search, and new formulas for Q(sqrt(-2)) and Q(sqrt(-5))\"."
authors:
  - family-names: Canli
    given-names: Arhan
    affiliation: Quantavane
    email: arhan@quantavane.com
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://quantavane.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arhancanli/quantavane-bbp-formulas"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
keywords:
  - BBP-type formulas
  - Dirichlet L-values
  - dilogarithm
  - Bloch group
  - five-term relation
  - exact verification
